# Child PACKAGE that ONLY calls `enforce_visibility_intersection()` --
# it does NOT call `package()`. Guards against the bug where the
# implementation could be refactored to share code with `package(...)`,
# whose omitted `within_view` arg normalizes to `["PUBLIC"]` and
# `extend_with(PUBLIC) -> PUBLIC` would silently disable the parent's
# within_view restriction.
enforce_visibility_intersection()
